{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26213","headline":"醉赠刘十二 · 殷尧藩","name":"醉赠刘十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春草正凄凄，知君过恶溪。\n莺将吉了语，猿共猓然啼。\n别路魂先断，还家梦几迷。\n定寻雷令劒，应识越王笄。\n树色多於北，潮声少向西。\n椰花好爲酒，谁伴醉如泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}